  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fight Human Trafficking in Texas</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Victims of human trafficking are all around us. We train people to recognize and respond to signs of trafficking, and we support victims once they are rescued from their traffickers. Victims often require medical care, a place to live, legal assistance and transportation to a safe community. Your gift raises awareness, saves people who are being trafficked, and helps victims begin a new life.</narrative>
  </description>
